{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1b05cf47-ba92-84f1-8b2e-3d673dc497b0",
  "created_at": "2026-02-23T13:05:56-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Luis Vieira",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:03:08-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:03:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. My name is Luis Vieira. I want to report a sidewalk problem. The sidewalk is heaved up, and I tripped on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:03:20-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry to hear that. Are you all right? Let me get some details. Where is the sidewalk exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:03:27-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It is at 342 Rhode Island Avenue. In Historic Hill. The slab in front is lifted, maybe two inches, one edge higher than the other."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:03:36-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, 342 Rhode Island Avenue, a raised slab of sidewalk about two inches. Did that happen recently, or has it been like that a while?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:03:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It got worse after last weekend's nor'easter, Saturday into Sunday. Frozen ground, then water, I think. Before it was small. Now it is big. I tripped yesterday, in the afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:03:56-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so you tripped Sunday afternoon. Did you get hurt at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, I am fine. Knee is a little sore. I did not fall all the way. But somebody else will, maybe older person."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:04:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. Do you have any photos of it? Those help the crew a lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I have photos. I took three with my phone. I can send them, if you give me where."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:04:22-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll have to get you the right place to send those. I'll note that photos are available, and I'll have someone from the office follow up with you on how to submit them. Is this the best number, the one you're calling from?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:04:37-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, landline. It is 401-555-0191."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:04:40-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0191. And what would you like us to do, Mr. Vieira?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:04:45-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Please add this street to the repair list. Sidewalk and also the road edge there is rough. I want it on the list for repair."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:04:54-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'll put in the request for 342 Rhode Island Avenue, sidewalk heaved and a trip hazard, and ask that it be added to the repair list. I can't tell you exactly when a crew will get out there, they've got a lot of calls after the storm, but it will be on record today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:05:13-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. That is fine. Sorry, one more thing. I was late calling because I waited for mail. I got a letter from a pen pal in Canada today, and I wanted to see photos first, then call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:05:26-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, well, that's nice. A real letter, those are rare. Okay, so let me read it back: Luis Vieira, 342 Rhode Island Avenue, raised sidewalk slab, you tripped Sunday, photos available, callback 401-555-0191. Did I get all that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:05:40-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Everything is right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:05:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. Someone will be in touch about the photos. Anything else I can help with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:05:49-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that is all. Thank you. Goodbye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-23T13:05:52-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Take care of that knee. Bye now."
    }
  ],
